---
// iOS App Store privacy policy. Keep console brand names off this page (App Store rules).
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="SambaS3 Emulator for iPhone — Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for SambaS3 Emulator for iPhone. The app collects no data."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:py-28">
    <p class="font-mono2 text-[11px] tracking-[0.28em] text-gold">IPHONE — PRIVACY POLICY</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide text-cream sm:text-4xl">SAMBAS3 EMULATOR FOR IPHONE: PRIVACY POLICY</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body leading-relaxed text-warm">Effective date: October 31, 2026</p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body leading-relaxed text-warm">
      SambaS3 Emulator ("the app") is an experimental console emulator for iPhone published by ZenithBlue.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 font-heading text-xl font-bold tracking-[0.1em] text-cream">DATA WE COLLECT</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body leading-relaxed text-warm">
      None. The app has no accounts, analytics, crash reporting, advertising or tracking, and it does not send any data
      to us or to third parties. App Privacy on the App Store says "Data Not Collected".
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 font-heading text-xl font-bold tracking-[0.1em] text-cream">DATA STORED ON YOUR DEVICE</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body leading-relaxed text-warm">The app keeps these files in its own storage on your iPhone:</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 font-body leading-relaxed text-warm">
      <li>game folders and system firmware that you import yourself;</li>
      <li>emulator settings, save data and caches created while you play;</li>
      <li>a session log with device and emulator diagnostics.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body leading-relaxed text-warm">
      They stay on your device. A log leaves it only when you tap "Share session log" and pick a destination in the
      iOS share sheet; that destination has its own privacy practices. Deleting the app removes all of these files.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 font-heading text-xl font-bold tracking-[0.1em] text-cream">CHILDREN</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body leading-relaxed text-warm">
      The app is not directed to children and does not knowingly collect information from anyone.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 font-heading text-xl font-bold tracking-[0.1em] text-cream">CHANGES AND CONTACT</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body leading-relaxed text-warm">
      Changes to this policy are published on this page with a new effective date. Questions:
      <a class="text-gold underline" href="mailto:zenithblue.dev@gmail.com">zenithblue.dev@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-12 font-body"><a class="text-gold underline" href="../">Support</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
